  ('Which course concept is illustrated by this example: running a .py script?','Python interpreter','["elif","bool","variable"]','The example illustrates Python interpreter.'),
  ('Which statement about Python interpreter is correct?','executes Python instructions','["a web browser","stores a value under a name","changes a value from one type to another"]','Python interpreter executes Python instructions.'),
  ('Which concept is best described as: “stores a value under a name”?','variable','["assignment operator =","type conversion","try/except"]','variable stores a value under a name.'),
  ('What is the main purpose or value of variable?','lets later statements reuse data','["assigns a value to a variable","combines values and operators","receives input into a function"]','variable is important because it lets later statements reuse data.'),
  ('Which course concept is illustrated by this example: total = 10?','variable','["try/except","type conversion","assignment operator ="]','The example illustrates variable.'),
  ('Which statement about variable is correct?','stores a value under a name','["a comment","assigns a value to a variable","combines values and operators"]','variable stores a value under a name.'),
