  ('Which course concept is illustrated by this example: order-to-cash?','business process','["data migration","sales and distribution","integrated database"]','The example illustrates business process.'),
  ('Which statement about business process is correct?','is a sequence of activities producing an outcome','["font selection","provides shared enterprise data","supports employee-related processes"]','business process is a sequence of activities producing an outcome.'),
