  ('Which statement about missing values is correct?','are absent observations','["automatic zeros always","puts numeric variables on comparable scales","is the middle ordered value"]','missing values are absent observations.'),
  ('Which concept is best described as: “puts numeric variables on comparable scales”?','feature scaling','["R-squared","median","box plot"]','feature scaling puts numeric variables on comparable scales.'),
